  <ti>(f,html,bold,open)Additional terms regarding generated Html-Files and AngularJS-Html-Files:(f,html,bold,close)</ti>
  <ti type="ul">GENERATOR generates Html-Files and AngularJS-Html-Files in the EXPORT-process.</ti>
  <ti type="ul">Both of these files will automatically include 2 links:&#xA;1. Link to the website of 'GENERATOR' and&#xA;2. link to the website of 'Xml-Robot'.</ti>
  <ti type="ul">You are allowed to update and change the two generated files according to your needs and purposes(e:s) (f,html,bold,open)BUT(f,html,bold,close) you are (f,html,bold,open)NOT allowed to remove or modify the two links!(f,html,bold,close) They have to stay intact and remain visible to the end-user.</ti>




